  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Sense Motive 5 ranks, Investigation sphere (Ascertain Activities).</p>\n<p>Whenever you use the Ascertain Activities talent, you can learn about the target’s actions within the last 48 hours.</p>\n<p>If you gain a detailed analysis when using the talent, you can spend 1 use of skill leverage to also learn the exact location that the activity took place, which may provide context to the gained analysis.</p>\n<p>For example, 'sitting in a library' would instead tell you the exact library the activity took place in. 'Running in a dusty street' would instead let you know the exact street and town (if relevant) the target was running in.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/investigation#toc57\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
